  Slug: eternal-confidence
  DisplayName: Eternal Confidence
  IconPath: icons/equipment/head/hat-cocked-purple.webp
  Description: As a swashbuckler at the peak of your skill, you swell with confidence
    and bravado in every attack. Your proficiency rank for your swashbuckler class
    DC increases to master. When you Strike as part of a finisher or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Opportune
    Riposte], you can give the Strike the failure effect from the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Confident
    Finisher] action, including the increase from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Precise
    Finisher] if you have that feat. You can do so only if the Strike uses a weapon
    or unarmed attack that you could use for Confident Finisher.
